go-ffmpeg-ffi

This project is a hard fork of ffgo:
https://github.com/obinnaokechukwu/ffgo

The fork baseline is upstream commit
8e9c9c1956ff22af83544d725bb32691256f0a3a.

The hard fork preserves the original Git history, license, and attribution.
Original authors and contributors retain credit for their work. Changes made in
go-ffmpeg-ffi are maintained independently and do not imply endorsement by the
original project.

Development and review of this hard fork may be assisted by OpenAI Codex. Human
maintainers review and remain responsible for every accepted change.

FFmpeg is a separate project and is not covered by this project's Apache-2.0
license. FFmpeg licensing depends on its build configuration. FFmpeg and its
marks belong to their respective owners; go-ffmpeg-ffi is not affiliated with
or endorsed by the FFmpeg project.
